Language course evaluations: Weight strictly positive known marks by positive credits, discarding other marks from both numerator and denominator. With no eligible assessment, report null. Round the reported average to two decimal places using half-up rounding.
Group by course_id; the complete key is contiguous. Keep arrival order.
